# Web client
# CHANGED: these used to point at a "ttrpg/..." prefix this repo doesn't
# actually have (utilities/javascript/... is the real path -- looks
# copy-pasted from fates-edge-docs' layout, which does use that prefix).
# The blanket node_modules/ and dist/ rules above already cover most of
# this, but keep the specific paths correct and non-misleading.
utilities/javascript/fates-edge-web-client/dist/
utilities/javascript/fates-edge-web-client/.vite/

# Desktop client
utilities/javascript/fates-edge-desktop-client/dist/
utilities/javascript/fates-edge-desktop-client/out/

# Discord bot
utilities/vtt_mods_bots/fates-edge-discord-bot/node_modules/

# Runtime data -- databases are generated/mutable state, not source; they
# don't diff/merge meaningfully and grow forever if tracked. See
# campaigns.db, which was tracked with real session data in its history.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

#misc

output.txt
*.tmp
